# The app holds personal data. Nothing that could carry a document belongs in the
# repository, and nothing that could grant access to the Dropbox account does
# either. The Dropbox keys in src/sync/appKey.ts are OAuth *client ids*, which are
# public by construction and appear in the consent screen URL; the App secret is
# never present here (SEC5).
